    "You know these facts: parent: frank, bob, dave and bob; parent: frank, dave, alice and bob; parent: frank, carol, alice and erin; parent: frank, bob, bob and bob.\nThe pattern is parent: frank, C, alice and bob.\nWhat is the unify C?",
