    "You know these facts: parent: erin, erin, frank and alice; parent: erin, alice, carol and alice; parent: erin, frank, bob and alice.\nThe pattern is parent: erin, B, bob and alice.\nWhat is the unify B?",
    "You know these facts: parent: frank, carol, erin and carol; parent: frank, bob, erin and carol; parent: erin, bob, erin and frank; parent: frank, bob, erin and alice.\nThe pattern is parent: D, bob, erin and carol.\nWhat is the unify D?",
    "You know these facts: parent: bob, frank, dave and alice; parent: alice, frank, dave and dave; parent: erin, frank, dave and frank; parent: alice, frank, carol and alice.\nThe pattern is parent: D, frank, dave and alice.\nWhat is the unify D?",
    "You know these facts: parent: alice, bob, dave and carol; parent: carol, frank, dave and carol; parent: alice, bob, bob and carol.\nThe pattern is parent: C, bob, dave and carol.\nWhat is the unify C?",
    "You know these facts: parent: carol, bob, erin and carol; parent: bob, bob, erin and frank; parent: dave, bob, carol and dave; parent: dave, bob, erin and carol.\nThe pattern is parent: dave, bob, erin and A.\nWhat is the unify A?",
    "You know these facts: parent: bob, frank, alice and bob; parent: dave, carol, alice and alice; parent: dave, erin, alice and bob; parent: alice, frank, alice and bob.\nThe pattern is parent: dave, D, alice and bob.\nWhat is the unify D?"
